Selenium Locator Practice

Demo page:
https://www.selenium.dev/selenium/web/locators_tests/locators.html

Use Selenium to locate elements on the contact form:

1. Find the first-name field with its class name and verify its ID is "fname" and its value is "Jane".
2. Find all fields with the "information" class and verify that there are two.
3. Find the last-name field by ID and verify its value is "Doe".
4. Find the newsletter checkbox by name and verify that it is a checkbox.
5. Find the "Selenium Official Page" link by its link text and verify its URL.
